        <div class="prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert max-w-none"><h3>Bugfixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fix <code>loki.source.file</code> missing lines after a log rotation. (<a href="https://github.com/grafana/alloy/pull/4501" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">#4501</a>)</li>
<li>Fix a panic in <code>otelcol.processor.transform</code> on empty statements. (<a href="https://github.com/grafana/alloy/pull/4498" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">#4498</a>)</li>
</ul></div>
        
