      <div class="release-body">
        
        <div class="prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert max-w-none"><h3>Breaking changes</h3>
<ul>
<li><code>prometheus.exporter.windows</code>: the <code>msmq</code> collector was removed upstream. (<a href="https://github.com/grafana/alloy/pull/4402" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">#4402</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Add <code>otelcol.receiver.tcplog</code>. (<a href="https://github.com/grafana/alloy/pull/4388" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">#4388</a>)</li>
<li><code>loki.write</code> can now retry on 429 responses with backoff.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Upgrading</h3>
<pre><code>helm upgrade alloy grafana/alloy --version 1.4.0
</code></pre></div>
        
